Peggy 18 hi i'm scott amos the executive  producer on Tomb Raider definitive  edition in this dev diary we'll look at  some of the technology and techniques we  use to bring Lara's world to life on the  next-gen consoles in our last video we  showed you Lara's improvements with her  new subsurface scattering the new  dynamic material blends on her skin and  more now let's take a look at what we  did to the environment around her we  went through every area in the game and  upgraded all the normal maps to make  everything feel like a real surface you  can reach out at touch  we took the textures to four times the  resolution so that they look great at  1080p and then layered all the new  normal and spec maps on top we hand  placed a ton of new vegetation foliage  of all types trees they react to the  wind as well as bushes and plants that  are physically simulated so they react  to Laura's movements we also have  reactive water you can see the surface  rippling respond to Laura's movements  it's a subtle detail that really helps  tie Laura to the world around her  new dynamically lifts particles mean  fire armors have a hotness and a glow to  them also individual raindrops are lit  by lightning and searchlights  our rewritten particle engine gives us  up to 15 times more particles in any  area we can use this to add dust  anything you can think of as particle  effects woodchips and sparks flying  around during combat fire embers during  an inferno we're even flocks of seagulls  we have thousands of seagulls launched  from a cliffside and fly into the sunset  all of this adds to the wow factor and  immersion of the world newly added  shadow casters means fires and  searchlights create realistic  silhouettes we also added full cloth  simulation  this thing's too realistic flapping of  Flags clothing and other debris all of  which are affected by the strength of  the wind  so that's a quick tour of some of the  things we've done to make Lara's world  next-gen from the new dynamic youlet  particle system to reactive water and  cloth to the enhanced lighting and  shadow casting this is truly the  definitive edition of Tomb Raider
 

